New files here are an independent bounded recorder and loader probe, not a port
of the Qualcomm renderer. No vendor license/activation checks are modified.
The pure parser retains numeric values and field lengths. Following the user's
explicit approval, the opt-in capture adapter also logs bounded navigation text
locally. Do not commit or publish these private logs.
The standalone probe does not negotiate guidance or intercept transport callbacks.
The capture build adds guarded identification and receive callbacks and requests
guidance only after the stock receive/dispatch function has returned. It never
publishes BAP/cluster output and leaves all received transport bytes unchanged.
Installation and vehicle validation are separate from host fixture tests.
